{"name":"Ishau","status":"ok","title":"Ishau","pageId":79555,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Ishau</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-ToA5e-p64_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ToA5e-p64-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ruins<br><small><b>Formerly:</b></small> Village</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Refuge Bay (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUmVmdWdlX0JheT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Refuge Bay</span>, <a href=\"/wiki/Chult\" title=\"Chult\">Chult</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Ishau</b> was a sunken village located at the bottom of <span class=\"new\" title=\"Refuge Bay (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUmVmdWdlX0JheT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Refuge Bay</span> in <a href=\"/wiki/Chult\" title=\"Chult\">Chult</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-ToA5e-p64_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ToA5e-p64-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ishau?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Periodically, <a href=\"/wiki/Sea_hag\" title=\"Sea hag\">sea hags</a> navigated through the ruins looking for treasure or the remains of the dead.<sup id=\"cite_ref-ToA5e-p64_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ToA5e-p64-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ishau?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After it sunk, Ishau was home to <a href=\"/wiki/Reef_shark\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reef shark\">reef</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Hunter_shark\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hunter shark\">hunter sharks</a>, along with aquatic <a href=\"/wiki/Dinosaur\" title=\"Dinosaur\">dinosaurs</a> called <a href=\"/wiki/Plesiosaur\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Plesiosaur\">plesiosaurs</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-ToA5e-p64_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ToA5e-p64-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ishau?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"metadata plainlinks stub\"><tbody><tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"></span></td>\n<td><i>This Realmslore article about a geographical location is a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:stub\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Wikipedia:stub\">stub</a>.  You can help the Forgotten Realms Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ishau?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</i></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</s